WEBVTT

00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:05.280
Always buying the top? There's a name for that.

00:00:05.330 --> 00:00:08.880
FOMO: the fear of missing out.

00:00:08.930 --> 00:00:15.070
Step one: gold rises twenty-five dollars. You see it too late.

00:00:15.120 --> 00:00:20.940
Step two: now or never? Your entry is often the pros' exit.

00:00:20.990 --> 00:00:27.000
Step three: plan first, wait for the pullback. Missed is not lost.

00:00:27.050 --> 00:00:31.100
Remember: there are new setups every day.

00:00:31.150 --> 00:00:36.450
I show planned setups live in my free group. Comment GOLD.
